---
// Terms.astro - Campaign terms, validity, and fair-use conditions
---

<section class="terms-section" aria-labelledby="terms-heading">
  <div class="terms-container">
    <div class="terms-box">
      <h2 id="terms-heading" class="terms-title">Campaign Terms & Details</h2>
      <ul class="terms-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <strong>Offer:</strong> ₹150 flat discount on orders above ₹300 across all beverages, bakes, and kitchen plates.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Validity:</strong> Code remains active for 30 calendar days from the date of generation.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Limit:</strong> Strictly one code redemption per person / mobile number.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Redemption:</strong> Please present your unique alphanumeric claim code to our counter team prior to bill settlement.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .terms-section {
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
  }

  .terms-container {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .terms-box {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5);
  }

  .terms-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .terms-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
  }

  .terms-list strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .terms-box {
      padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
    }
  }
</style>
